# Cloudflare static assets (the app served by its Worker): cross-origin isolation,
# so the speech model runs on up to 4 CPU threads instead of 1 (onnxruntime-web
# uses threads only in a crossOriginIsolated page). "credentialless" keeps the
# scripts and model files from jsDelivr and Hugging Face loading as before.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
